WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.709 --> 00:00:02.961
We've received reports saying
the roads have been blocked as well.

00:00:03.086 --> 00:00:05.964
We got those reports too! They say
it's all ruins outside of Shibuya.

00:00:06.089 --> 00:00:07.257
That's ridiculous.

00:00:08.591 --> 00:00:10.468
That's not a terrorist attack, is it?

00:00:10.802 --> 00:00:11.803
Terrorists?

00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:16.099
What's that?

00:00:19.602 --> 00:00:22.188
Are those guys inside there alive?

00:00:22.272 --> 00:00:23.732
I detect signs of life.

00:00:23.815 --> 00:00:25.692
It's a bio-cage.

00:00:25.775 --> 00:00:27.527
As long as they're inside it,
they are alive.

00:00:27.610 --> 00:00:28.862
You can ignore it during battle.

00:00:28.945 --> 00:00:29.779
Ignore it?

00:00:32.449 --> 00:00:33.867
What are you doing, Daisuke?

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:35.493
I have to save them!

00:00:35.577 --> 00:00:36.745
You're not ready for that.

00:00:36.828 --> 00:00:38.955
This is the first time
you're using a String Puppet!

00:00:39.039 --> 00:00:40.373
And without a neurosuit too.

00:00:40.457 --> 00:00:42.667
That lowers your power and speed.

00:00:42.751 --> 00:00:44.294
If they're alive, I have to save them!

00:00:45.295 --> 00:00:47.881
That's what I had been
working so hard for!

00:00:48.423 --> 00:00:51.676
-What are you talking about?
-You told me to protect everyone!

00:00:52.427 --> 00:00:54.387
Right now, focus on destroying the enemy.

00:00:54.471 --> 00:00:55.555
Switch to burst mode shots.

00:00:55.638 --> 00:00:58.308
-From that position, focus on its legs.
-I can't!

00:00:58.391 --> 00:01:00.977
I'll hit the guys inside!

00:01:01.019 --> 00:01:02.771
It will get you first. Shoot!

00:01:02.854 --> 00:01:05.148
No! I'm going to save them!

00:01:05.231 --> 00:01:07.442
They're more ignorant than we expected.

00:01:08.777 --> 00:01:10.070
Okay.

00:01:13.281 --> 00:01:14.532
-The connections!
-What?

00:01:15.283 --> 00:01:18.161
If you destroy the two connecting points,
you can remove it.

00:01:18.328 --> 00:01:20.413
Milo! Thank you!

00:01:20.997 --> 00:01:23.166
There it is!

00:01:32.634 --> 00:01:33.635
I did it!

00:01:55.073 --> 00:01:56.741
Good job, Daisuke.

00:01:56.825 --> 00:01:57.659
I defeated it.

00:01:57.909 --> 00:01:59.202
Hey, Daisuke.

00:02:00.203 --> 00:02:02.413
Wow, I am amazing!

00:02:02.747 --> 00:02:04.666
Now, I can protect everyone!

00:02:04.749 --> 00:02:07.919
It was just like what Milo said,
this is my destiny!

00:02:08.211 --> 00:02:09.712
Are you hurt, Daisuke?

00:02:10.046 --> 00:02:11.756
-Daisuke!
-I'm fine!

